// "[subject] loses N life" ([CR#119.3]) — the third-person life-loss verb
// phrase, `GainsLife`'s twin. A parse/render template over the core
// `ChangeLife` verb for the declarative-subject production ("Each opponent
// loses 2 life", "Target player loses 1 life"); expands in place to
// `ChangeLife(who, Down(n))`.
//
// `who` (Param(0)) is a REAL slot — see `GainsLife.ron` for why the subject
// moved into the macro when the action role reshape deleted `By`.
//
// Usage: LosesLife(It, 2) / LosesLife(Target(0), 1).
(
    name: "LosesLife",
    template: "${0} loses ${1} life",
    kinds: [Action],
    params: [Reference, Count],
    body: ChangeLife(Param(0), Down(Param(1))),
)
